    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>An intellect devourer resembles a walking brain protected by a crusty covering and set on bestial clawed legs. This foul aberration feeds on the intelligence of sentient creatures, taking over a victim's body on behalf of its mind flayer masters.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">噬腦怪就像一個包裹在堅硬外殼裏，長着野獸爪子的行走大腦。這種怪異的異怪以智能生物的智力爲食，並代表它的奪心魔主人來接管受害者的身體.</span></p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Illithid Creations\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Illithid Creations.</span> Mind flayers breed intellect devourers to serve as roaming hunters of the Underdark, creating an intellect devourer by taking the brain of a thrall and subjecting it to a horrible ritual. As it sprouts legs, the brain becomes an intelligent predator as twisted and evil as its masters.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>靈吸怪造物Illithid Creations。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">奪心魔從受其控制的對象中抽出大腦並通過可怕的儀式製成噬腦怪，然後培育它爲自己在幽暗地域中漫遊狩獵。長出腿腳的噬腦怪就變成了一隻具有智能的狩獵者，並且如同其主人一樣扭曲邪惡。</span></p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deadly Puppet Masters\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Deadly Puppet Masters.</span> An intellect devourer consumes a creature's mind and memories, then turns the host body into a puppet under its control. An intellect devourer typically uses its puppet host to lure others into the domain of the mind flayers to be enthralled or consumed.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>致命的傀儡大師Deadly Puppet Masters。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">噬腦怪吞食生物的思想和記憶，然後將其身體變成受自己操控的傀儡。噬腦怪通常會用它的傀儡來引誘別人進入奪心魔的領地，以供它們控制和食用。</span></p></div></div><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset rd__b-inset--readaloud\"><div class=\"rd__quote\"><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\"><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em>“別哭。我們沒打算喫掉你的腦子。事實上，你的大腦將要去參加一趟奇妙的旅行！“</em></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 70.05pt;text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em>奪心魔 豁裏</em></span><span style=\"font-family:'MS Mincho'\"><em>?</em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><em>艾爾斯拉克Qorik el-Slurrk</em></span></p><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\"></p><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\">“<em>Don't cry. We have no intention of eating your brain. In fact, your brain is going on a wonderful journey!</em>”</p><p><span class=\"rd__quote-by\">— Qorik el-Slurrk, mind flayer</span></p></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
