    {
      "_id": "slfNEvJ8FE6bpXbK",
      "name": "吞食智力Devour Intellect",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "191",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">噬腦怪指定其周邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺內一個具有大腦的生物。該目標必須進行一次</span> [[/save ability=int dc=12]]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">以對抗該魔法，豁免失敗者將受到</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">11</span>([[/damage 2d10 type=psychic]])<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">點心靈傷害。豁免失敗時還要再骰一次</span>[[/r 3d6]]: <span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">若總骰值等於或大於該目標的智力值，則該屬性值降爲</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">0</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">。該目標陷入</span>&amp;Reference[condition=stunned]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">，直至其恢復至少一點智力屬性。</span></p><p></p><p>The intellect devourer targets one creature it can see within 10 feet of it that has a brain. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=int dc=12]] saving throw against this magic or take 11 ([[/damage 2d10 type=psychic]]) damage. Also on a failure, roll [[/r 3d6]]: If the total equals or exceeds the target's Intelligence score, that score is reduced to 0. The target is &amp;Reference[condition=stunned] until it regains at least one point of Intelligence.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
