    {
      "_id": "nwQT65IclvoLXAEA",
      "name": "竊取身體 Body Thief",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "191",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">噬腦怪與其周邊</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺範圍內一個未受法術</span>@spell[protection from evil and good]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">保護，且正陷入</span>&amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated] <span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">的類人生物進行智力對抗。如果噬腦怪贏得對抗，則其以魔法吸收該生物的大腦，並傳送進該目標的頭骨內接管該目標的身體。在該生物體內時，噬腦怪對所有攻擊與源於外界的所有效應視爲處於</span>&amp;Reference[rule=totalcover]{total cover}<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">狀態。該噬腦怪保留其智力、感知和魅力值，依然懂得深潛語、心靈感應並保留其所有特質。它的其他屬性將繼承該目標的資料。它知曉所有該生物知曉的事，包括其法術和語言。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">宿主身體死亡時，該噬腦怪必須脫離該軀體。對宿主身體施展法術</span>@spell[protection from evil and good]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">可以將其內的噬腦怪驅趕出來。目標通過法術</span>@spell[wish]<span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">恢復其被吞噬的大腦時，該噬腦怪也將被強行抽離。噬腦怪可以花費</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺移動力主動離開身體，並傳送到身體附近</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺內最接近的一處未被佔據位置。噬腦怪離開後，除非其大腦在</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">輪內復原否則該身體死亡。</span></p><p></p><p>The intellect devourer initiates an Intelligence contest with an &amp;Reference[condition=incapacitated] humanoid within 5 feet of it that isn't protected by @spell[protection from evil and good]. If it wins the contest, the intellect devourer magically consumes the target's brain, teleports into the target's skull, and takes control of the target's body. While inside a creature, the intellect devourer has &amp;Reference[rule=totalcover]{total cover} against attacks and other effects originating outside its host. The intellect devourer retains its Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores, as well as its understanding of Deep Speech, its telepathy, and its traits. It otherwise adopts the target's statistics. It knows everything the creature knew, including spells and languages.</p><p>If the host body dies, the intellect devourer must leave it. A @spell[protection from evil and good] spell cast on the body drives the intellect devourer out. The intellect devourer is also forced out if the target regains its devoured brain by means of a @spell[wish]. By spending 5 feet of its movement, the intellect devourer can voluntarily leave the body, teleporting to the nearest unoccupied space within 5 feet of it. The body then dies, unless its brain is restored within 1 round.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
        "uses": {
